  "description": "VESWAT crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C203 H278 Dy7 N9 O31,3(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 16 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.559-4.621 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.58-159.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C203H278Dy7N9O31·3(C3H7NO). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
